.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/storybook-static
**/*.md
.DS_Store
infra

# Never let a local secrets file end up in a build context — a build arg or a
# stray COPY would bake it into a published image layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# PocketBase reads only *.pb.js from pb_hooks, but the directory must be
# non-empty for the image's COPY to succeed.
!apps/pocketbase/pb_hooks/README.md
